2) EXECUTIVE SUMMARY (3–6 bullets)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- What works in code: Windows C# agent (foreground whitelist, idle gate, zonal
  screen OCR via Windows.Media.Ocr, region hash skip, AES-GCM optional queue,
  HTTP POST to FastAPI); Python FastAPI brain (/healthz, /analyze, HF inference,
  Supabase insert); Streamlit dashboard (filters, alerts, 7-day mood heatmap,
  process-level star graph); SQL schema script for Supabase.
- What is stub / partial: Betweenness centrality and full relationship score R
  are NOT implemented (post-MVP per plan §12). Hosts-file blocking, WS_EX_LAYERED
  blackout overlay, Supabase Realtime push, JWT (plan said API key for MVP) —
  NOT implemented unless added later.
- Demo blockers until you configure: align BrainApiKey (agent) with BRAIN_API_KEY
  (brain); set HF_TOKEN; Supabase URL + service role; run schema.sql; tune
  ScreenRegion in appsettings.json to your monitor/chat layout.
- Build verification: Agent was not compiled in the last automated environment
  (no .NET SDK there). You MUST run locally: dotnet build on the .csproj.

