  Tables: events, alerts (alerts table unused by brain insert in current code)
  RLS:    Disabled in schema for MVP hackathon speed (re-enable for production)

Dashboard (Streamlit)
  Status: Implemented
  File:   ProjectGuardian/dashboard/app.py
  Views:  Device/date filters, alert table, events table, Plotly heatmap, Plotly
          star graph (MVP: device → process nodes)

