5) WHAT WAS DONE (THIS SESSION / LAST KNOWN — tie to files)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Scaffolded ProjectGuardian/agent with Guardian.Agent.csproj + WinRT OCR path.
2. Implemented whitelist + idle + orchestrator throttle + OcrManager region hash.
3. Implemented LocalQueue AES-GCM + MachineKey (MachineGuid-derived key material).
4. Implemented UploadClient named HttpClient "brain" to POST /analyze.
5. Implemented brain/main.py: HF sentiment + optional risk model + heuristic fallback.
6. Added supabase/schema.sql; brain inserts into public.events when configured.
7. Implemented dashboard/app.py for heatmap + graph MVP.
8. Wrote README.md; this SNAPSHOT.doc (audited for §8.1 completeness).
9. Tightened §0 protocol: update SNAPSHOT after **every** file change; no arbitrary
   terminal commands; no auto-install — user installs; README + root SNAPSHOT aligned.
10. Added MANUAL_STEPS.md — single file for all user-run commands and manual setup;
    README links; §0 requires new steps to be documented there.

