================================================================================
§8.2 QUALITY BAR (must pass before considering snapshot “done”)
================================================================================
Use together with section 0) above (when to edit + per-section checklist).
[ ] SNAPSHOT was updated in the **same session** as the last file change (every change).
[ ] File tree matches disk (or explicitly lists “not created”).
[ ] Next TODO is specific (no “continue development”).
[ ] What was done references concrete files/paths.
[ ] Blockers explicit or stated as none (see §2).
[ ] No secret values pasted in this document.
[ ] README.md in same folder points here for live state and to MANUAL_STEPS.md (see §8.3).

================================================================================
§8.3 README ALIGNMENT
================================================================================
See ProjectGuardian/README.md — must stay in sync: purpose, folder map, installs,
run commands, env var names, link to MANUAL_STEPS.md, and line: “See SNAPSHOT.doc
for current session state.” MANUAL_STEPS.md holds all user-executable commands and
manual UI steps in one place.
